Contains data from the Nobel Prize API (https://www.nobelprize.org/about/developer-zone-2/),
api.nobelprize.org v2.1, offered under the Creative Commons Zero (CC0) licence by its terms
of use: https://www.nobelprize.org/about/terms-of-use-for-api-nobelprize-org-and-data-nobelprize-org/
Source: nobelprize.org. No endorsement by Nobel Prize Outreach is implied.

The six JSON files in this folder are derived from the API's laureates endpoint: every
laureate with a prize awarded to 2025, their awards, categories, the institutions they were
affiliated with when awarded, and the countries of birth and of those institutions. They are
not committed: infra/dev/examples/nobel/fetch.sh derives them, and it is the full description
of how — a projection of the API's fields, nothing altered.
